{"id": 1002742, "slug": "forklift-certified-stacked-and-loaded", "name": "Forklift Certified: Stacked and Loaded", "name_original": "Forklift Certified: Stacked and Loaded", "description": "<p><strong>Stack fast. Crash harder. Get certified.</strong><br/>Forklift Certified: Stacked &amp; Loaded is a chaotic 4-player couch co-op party game where you and your crew take on the ultimate warehouse challenge. Load crates, dodge disasters, and try not to trip over the inventory—or each other.</p><p>Work together (or not) through <strong>stacks of levels</strong> escalating in logistical madness, from calm tutorial bays to frantic arenas full of crates, conveyor belts, and unpredictable warehouse hazards. Whether you're in the same room or using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, teamwork is optional—fun is guaranteed.<br/><br/>🔑 Key Features</p><ul><li><p><strong>4-Player Couch Co-op</strong>: Play locally or via <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Crate-Loads of Levels</strong>: From smooth operations to total catastrophe.</p></li><li><p><strong>Certified Chaos</strong>: Drift, crash, launch, and occasionally deliver crates.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong>: Track your progress through the game and be rewarded.</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-05-05", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-05-09T08:49:09", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/66b/66b8bdf341c4bb3c93d8af6bc05965a5.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/11f/11fa5541cc45addc19a3d481c6c87bca.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "